    <header class="top">
      <div class="crumb"><span class="jd">63.11</span><span>WBWN Chad</span><span class="sep">/</span><span>Programs</span><span class="sep">/</span><b>Chad Initiative</b></div>
      <div class="search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m16.5 16.5 4 4"/></svg><span>Search everything</span><span class="k">⌘K</span></div>
      <div class="tacts">
        <div class="seg">
          <button class="{{mRead}}" onClick="{{setRead}}">Read</button>
          <button class="{{mEdit}}" onClick="{{setEdit}}">Edit</button>
          <button class="{{mSug}}" onClick="{{setSug}}">Suggest</button>
        </div>
        <button class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M9 13h7M9 17h4"/></svg>Export PDF</button>
        <button class="btn p"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg>Request publish</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="body" style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start">

      <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="cbd" style="padding:18px 22px 14px">
            <p class="eyebrow">Program · charter (NISO)</p>
            <h1>Chad Initiative</h1>
            <p class="lede">{{modeNote}}</p>
            <div class="chips" style="margin-top:11px">
              <span class="chip on">markdown at rest</span>
              <span class="chip">v37 · saved 2026-08-24 16:12</span>
              <span class="chip">3 open suggestions</span>
              <span class="chip">2 required policies</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cbd" style="border-top:1px solid #E7EEF2;padding:16px 22px 20px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.62">
            <h3 style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A6E7A;margin-bottom:5px">Need</h3>
            <p style="margin:0 0 14px">Fourteen languages in the eastern cluster have no scripture in a form the local church can use, and the three partner organizations working there keep separate records that do not reconcile.</p>

            <h3 style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A6E7A;margin-bottom:5px">Idea</h3>
            <p style="margin:0 0 14px">
              Run one church-centric cohort per cluster,
              <sc-if value="{{redline}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}"><span style="background:#FBE7E7;color:#9B2C2C;text-decoration:line-through">with quarterly in-person check-ins</span> <span style="background:#E2F3E7;color:#1F6B39">with monthly remote check-ins and two in-person visits per year</span></sc-if>
              <sc-if value="{{clean}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">with monthly remote check-ins and two in-person visits per year</sc-if>,
              training local facilitators who can train the next cohort without us.
            </p>

            <h3 style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A6E7A;margin-bottom:5px">Strategy</h3>
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Three projects run in sequence, each pulling from the parking lot only when the previous one clears its WIP limit:</p>
            <ul style="margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:20px;color:#3A4A53">
              <li>Facilitator cohort — 12 trainers across 4 partner organizations</li>
              <li>Open Bible Stories drafting — 14 languages, checked against the gateway language</li>
              <li>Community checking and publishing to the open licence</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A6E7A;margin-bottom:5px">Outcomes &amp; expected evidence</h3>
            <table class="tbl" style="margin-bottom:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
              <thead><tr><th>Outcome</th><th>Metric</th><th class="num">Target</th><th class="num">Latest</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>Local trainers able to run a cohort unaided</td><td class="mono">trainers_certified</td><td class="num">12</td><td class="num">7</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Stories drafted and community-checked</td><td class="mono">obs_completions</td><td class="num">14</td><td class="num">5</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Partner organizations reporting into FRED directly</td><td class="mono">orgs_self_reporting</td><td class="num">4</td><td class="num">2</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>

            <h3 style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A6E7A;margin-bottom:5px">Risks</h3>
            <p style="margin:0">Travel access to the eastern cluster is not guaranteed; the contingency is a remote-only cohort at reduced pace, costed in the work order. Records for this program are <b>sensitivity: protected</b> — engagement detail never reaches published pages or org-wide dashboards.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="prov">
            <span>Page</span><span class="mono">chad-initiative@v37</span><span>·</span>
            <span>last edit <b>human:jesse</b> 2026-08-24 16:12</span><span>·</span>
            <span>sha256 <span class="mono">4f9c…a12b</span></span><span>·</span><a>History</a><a>Export</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="chd">
            <h2>{{panelTitle}}</h2>
            <div class="r">
              <button class="{{tSugC}}" onClick="{{goSug}}">Suggestions ({{nSug}})</button>
              <button class="{{tVerC}}" onClick="{{goVer}}">Versions</button>
              <button class="{{tLinkC}}" onClick="{{goLink}}">Backlinks</button>
              <button class="{{tPolC}}" onClick="{{goPol}}">Policies</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cbd flush">
            <sc-for list="{{rows}}" as="r" hint-placeholder-count="4">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7EEF2">
                <span class="b {{r.tone}}">{{r.tag}}</span>
                <div style="min-width:0;flex:1">
                  <div style="font-weight:700">{{r.title}}</div>
                  <div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600">{{r.meta}}</div>
                </div>
                <sc-if value="{{r.decidable}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
                  <button class="btn sm p" onClick="{{r.accept}}">Accept</button>
                  <button class="btn sm" onClick="{{r.reject}}">Reject</button>
                </sc-if>
                <sc-if value="{{r.decided}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
                  <span class="b {{r.decidedTone}}">{{r.decidedLabel}}</span>
                </sc-if>
              </div>
            </sc-for>
            <div style="padding:10px 14px;color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600">{{panelFoot}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside style="width:334px;flex:0 0 334px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="chd"><h2>Properties</h2><div class="r"><span class="b n">typed frontmatter</span></div></div>
          <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0">
            <sc-for list="{{props}}" as="p" hint-placeholder-count="9">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F1F5F8">
                <div style="width:112px;flex:0 0 112px;color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700">{{p.k}}</div>
                <div style="min-width:0;font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px">{{p.v}}</div>
              </div>
            </sc-for>
            <div style="padding-top:9px;color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">Frontmatter is form-edited and field-level merged — two people editing different fields both win.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="chd"><h2>Rollup</h2><div class="r"><span class="b n">follows the cascade</span></div></div>
          <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:16px">
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Committed</span><span class="v" style="font-size:18px">$412,000</span><span class="d">3 work orders</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Actual FY26</span><span class="v" style="font-size:18px">$286,410</span><span class="d">69% of budget</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bar"><i style="width:69%"></i></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:16px">
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Engagements</span><span class="v" style="font-size:18px">14</span><span class="d">FRED · protected</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Stories</span><span class="v" style="font-size:18px">6</span><span class="d">1 publishable</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="chd"><h2>Linked</h2></div>
          <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px">
            <sc-for list="{{links}}" as="l" hint-placeholder-count="5">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
                <span class="b {{l.tone}}">{{l.rel}}</span>
                <a style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px">{{l.name}}</a>
              </div>
            </sc-for>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
